    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push letters to form words in <i>Spell Slide</i>\u2014a unique word game with two distinct modes. In <i>Creative</i> mode, discover as many words as you can to boost your score and unlock new levels. In <i>Puzzle</i> mode, each world introduces new mechanics: from bespoke single-solution challenges, to puzzles where spelling specific words opens doors, to strategy levels with companion robots, and even cryptic clue-based conundrums. Whether you're into freeform wordplay or structured problem-solving, <i>Spell Slide</i> lets you play your way.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push letters to form words in <i>Spell Slide</i>\u2014a unique word game with two distinct modes. In <i>Creative</i> mode, discover as many words as you can to boost your score and unlock new levels. In <i>Puzzle</i> mode, each world introduces new mechanics: from bespoke single-solution challenges, to puzzles where spelling specific words opens doors, to strategy levels with companion robots, and even cryptic clue-based conundrums. Whether you're into freeform wordplay or structured problem-solving, <i>Spell Slide</i> lets you play your way.</p>",
    "short_description": "Slide letters to spell words in this creative puzzle game. Discover as many words as you can, or solve handcrafted challenges with logic, strategy, and cryptic clues. Two distinct modes let you play freely or tackle puzzles at your own pace.",
